                               Preamble

  ShopVPN is a Telegram bot, mini app, admin web panel, web store and related
tooling for running a VPN-configuration shop. The author publishes the source
code so that people can read it, run it, learn from it and improve it.

  This license has one purpose: to let you SELL VPN CONFIGURATIONS AND
SUBSCRIPTIONS to your own customers using ShopVPN, while keeping everything
else about the software, including selling, hosting, renting, repackaging or
making money from the software itself, reserved to the author.

  Like the GNU Affero General Public License, it is a copyleft license with a
network clause: if you change the software and let other people use your
version over a network (a Telegram bot, a mini app, a web panel, a web store),
you must give those people the source code of your version, under this same
license. Unlike the AGPL, it does not grant general commercial rights.

  The precise terms and conditions follow.

